{"id":"de-witze-1rg19si.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1rg19si","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line. Both hunters are on screen with rifles; the call is a split screen with the operator at her desk. The hunter walks to his friend with the rifle during the silence, then picks up the phone again for the punchline.","title":"Охотники","location":"derevnya","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Два охотника идут по лесу, как вдруг один из них падает.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Второй в панике звонит в службу спасения.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Мой друг умер! Что мне делать?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"Успокойтесь. Сначала нам нужно убедиться, что он действительно мёртв.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"В трубке тишина, потом раздаётся выстрел.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Так, а теперь что?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#5b6b3a"}},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-sosed","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"}]},{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","uchilka"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter","muzhik-sosed":"hunter","uchilka":"operator"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#5b6b3a"}},"split":{"location":"ofis","cast":["uchilka"]},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"uchilka","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"pause","sec":1},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rg19si.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1rg19si","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line. Both hunters are on screen with rifles; the call is a split screen with the operator at her desk. The hunter walks to his friend with the rifle during the silence, then picks up the phone again for the punchline.","title":"The Hunters","location":"derevnya","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Two hunters are walking through the forest when one of them suddenly collapses.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"The other one calls emergency services in a panic.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"My friend is dead! What should I do?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"uchilka","text":"Calm down. First we need to make sure he's really dead.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Silence on the line, then a shot.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Okay, and now what?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#5b6b3a"}},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-sosed","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"}]},{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","uchilka"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter","muzhik-sosed":"hunter","uchilka":"operator"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#5b6b3a"}},"split":{"location":"ofis","cast":["uchilka"]},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"uchilka","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"pause","sec":1},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1xrms30.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1xrms30","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"The post title about the scientific study is not part of the joke and is dropped. Spoken lines kept as written; 'versucht ihn zu beruhigen und sagt mit sanfter Stimme' is shown by the calm operator and cut. The operator is a man in the source, so paren with a headset plays him in the split screen.","title":"Die Jäger","location":"derevnya","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Zwei Jäger sind im Wald, als einer von beiden plötzlich zusammenbricht.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er atmet nicht mehr und sein Blick ist starr.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der andere Jäger greift völlig panisch zum Telefon und wählt den Notruf.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Mein Freund ist tot! Was soll ich bloß tun?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Ganz ruhig, ich kann Ihnen helfen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"paren","text":"Stellen Sie als Erstes absolut sicher, dass er wirklich tot ist.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Am Telefon ist kurz Stille, dann hört man einen lauten Schuss.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Okay, erledigt. Und was jetzt?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#5b6b3a"}},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-sosed","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"}]},{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter","muzhik-sosed":"hunter","paren":"operator"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#5b6b3a"},"paren":{"add":["headset"]}},"split":{"location":"ofis","cast":["paren"]},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"pause","sec":1},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1xrms30.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1xrms30","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"The post title about the scientific study is dropped. Translated line by line; the operator is a man in the source, so paren with a headset plays him in the split screen.","title":"Охотники","location":"derevnya","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Два охотника в лесу, и вдруг один из них падает.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Он не дышит, и взгляд у него застыл.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Второй охотник в полной панике хватается за телефон и звонит в службу спасения.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Мой друг умер! Что же мне делать?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Спокойно, я вам помогу.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"paren","text":"Первым делом абсолютно точно убедитесь, что он действительно мёртв.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"В трубке ненадолго тишина, потом раздаётся громкий выстрел.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Так, готово. А теперь что?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#5b6b3a"}},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-sosed","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"}]},{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter","muzhik-sosed":"hunter","paren":"operator"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#5b6b3a"},"paren":{"add":["headset"]}},"split":{"location":"ofis","cast":["paren"]},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"pause","sec":1},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1xrms30.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1xrms30","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"The post title about the scientific study is dropped. Translated line by line; the operator is a man in the source, so paren with a headset plays him in the split screen.","title":"The Hunters","location":"derevnya","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Two hunters are in the forest when one of them suddenly collapses.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"He isn't breathing and his eyes are fixed.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"The other hunter grabs his phone in a total panic and dials the emergency number.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"My friend is dead! What on earth should I do?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Easy now, I can help you.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"paren","text":"First, make absolutely sure he's really dead.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"There's a moment of silence on the line, then a loud shot.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik-ryzhy","text":"Okay, done. Now what?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","cast":["muzhik-sosed","muzhik-ryzhy"],"roles":{"muzhik-sosed":"hunter","muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#5b6b3a"}},"beats":[{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-sosed","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"}]},{"location":"derevnya","place":"forest","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik-ryzhy","muzhik-sosed","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik-ryzhy":"hunter","muzhik-sosed":"hunter","paren":"operator"},"looks":{"muzhik-sosed":{"clothes":"#5b6b3a"},"paren":{"add":["headset"]}},"split":{"location":"ofis","cast":["paren"]},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"center"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-sosed","to":"tree"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"prop","who":"paren","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"rifle","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","to":"right"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"pause","sec":1},{"type":"prop","who":"muzhik-ryzhy","item":"phone","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1x58isu.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1x58isu","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Three little boys: vovochka and vovochka-drug, plus devochka dressed as a boy (short hair, no bows, blue clothes) since the family has no third boy. Lines kept as written; speeds written out as words. The civil-servant father is only mentioned.","title":"Geschwindigkeitsrausch","location":"ulitsa","cast":["devochka","vovochka-drug","vovochka"],"roles":{"devochka":"child","vovochka-drug":"child","vovochka":"child"},"looks":{"devochka":{"hairStyle":"short","remove":["bows"],"clothes":"#4a6fa5"}},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Drei kleine Buben streiten sich darum, wessen Vater am schnellsten ist.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devochka","text":"Mein Vater fährt einen Porsche und erreicht locker dreihundert Kilometer pro Stunde!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"Ist doch gar nichts.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"Mein Vater ist Pilot bei der Lufthansa und fliegt eine Boeing, die mit mindestens siebenhundert Kilometer pro Stunde abzischt!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Das ist alles überhaupt nichts. Mein Vater ist Beamter.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Um fünf Uhr abends hat er Dienstschluss und um halb vier ist er zu Hause!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1x58isu.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1x58isu","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; Lufthansa becomes Aeroflot for a Russian ear, Beamter is a чиновник. Three boys: vovochka, vovochka-drug and devochka dressed as a boy.","title":"Самый быстрый папа","location":"ulitsa","cast":["devochka","vovochka-drug","vovochka"],"roles":{"devochka":"child","vovochka-drug":"child","vovochka":"child"},"looks":{"devochka":{"hairStyle":"short","remove":["bows"],"clothes":"#4a6fa5"}},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Три мальчика спорят, чей папа самый быстрый.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devochka","text":"Мой папа ездит на Порше и легко разгоняется до трёхсот километров в час!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"Да это ерунда.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"Мой папа лётчик в Аэрофлоте и летает на Боинге, который несётся минимум семьсот километров в час!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Это всё вообще ерунда. Мой папа чиновник.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Рабочий день у него заканчивается в пять вечера, а в половине четвёртого он уже дома!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1x58isu.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1x58isu","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; km/h converted to miles an hour. Three boys: vovochka, vovochka-drug and devochka dressed as a boy.","title":"Fastest Dad","location":"ulitsa","cast":["devochka","vovochka-drug","vovochka"],"roles":{"devochka":"child","vovochka-drug":"child","vovochka":"child"},"looks":{"devochka":{"hairStyle":"short","remove":["bows"],"clothes":"#4a6fa5"}},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Three little boys are arguing about whose dad is the fastest.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devochka","text":"My dad drives a Porsche and easily does a hundred and eighty miles an hour!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"That's nothing.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"vovochka-drug","text":"My dad's a pilot for Lufthansa and flies a Boeing that shoots off at four hundred and thirty miles an hour at least!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"That's all nothing at all. My dad's a civil servant.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"vovochka","text":"He finishes work at five in the evening, and he's home by half past three!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rzob44.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1rzob44","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Dialogue kept as written. The two gifted parrots are shown as birdcages the salesman holds and sets down one after the other; ptitsa in grey plays the small old ugly parrot in the corner.","title":"Der Chef","location":"magazin","cast":["muzhik","barmen","ptitsa"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"salesman","ptitsa":"parrot"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Kommt ein Kunde in eine Tierhandlung und fragt:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Was kostet denn dieser Papagei da?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Tausend Euro.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Wieso ist der denn so teuer?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Das ist ein sehr begabter Vogel, er kann fließend sprechen und bis hundert zählen.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Und was kostet der da?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Tausendfünfhundert Euro.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"So teuer schon wieder?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Oh, das ist ein noch begabterer Vogel, der spricht fließend drei Sprachen und kann die gesamten Werke von Goethe auswendig!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Da sieht der Kunde in der Ecke einen kleinen alten hässlichen Papagei.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Und der da hinten, der kostet doch sicher viel weniger?!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Nein, der kostet dreitausend Euro.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Wie bitte? Was kann der denn?!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ich weiß es auch nicht, der hat noch nie gesprochen, aber die beiden anderen nennen ihn „Chef“.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"magazin","cast":["muzhik","barmen","ptitsa"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"salesman","ptitsa":"parrot"},"looks":{"ptitsa":{"clothes":"#8a8a7a","skin":"#8a8a7a"}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"ptitsa","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"birdcage","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"birdcage","action":"put"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"birdcage","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"},{"type":"line","ref":"l14"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rzob44.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1rzob44","locale":"ru","adaptation":"reworked","notes":"Translated line by line; Goethe becomes Pushkin as the adapt note suggests, euros become dollars. The two gifted parrots are birdcages the salesman holds and sets down; ptitsa in grey is the small old ugly parrot in the corner.","title":"Шеф","location":"magazin","cast":["muzhik","barmen","ptitsa"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"salesman","ptitsa":"parrot"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Покупатель заходит в зоомагазин и спрашивает:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Сколько стоит вот этот попугай?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Тысячу долларов.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"А почему так дорого?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Это очень способная птица, он свободно говорит и умеет считать до ста.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"А вот этот сколько стоит?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Полторы тысячи долларов.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Опять так дорого?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"О, это ещё более способная птица, он свободно говорит на трёх языках и знает наизусть всего Пушкина!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Тут покупатель замечает в углу маленького старого страшненького попугая.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"А вон тот, подальше, он-то уж наверняка стоит намного меньше?!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Нет, он стоит три тысячи долларов.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Что? А он-то что умеет?!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"barmen","text":"Я и сам не знаю, он ещё ни разу не говорил, но те двое называют его «Шеф».","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"magazin","cast":["muzhik","barmen","ptitsa"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"salesman","ptitsa":"parrot"},"looks":{"ptitsa":{"clothes":"#8a8a7a","skin":"#8a8a7a"}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"ptitsa","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"birdcage","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"birdcage","action":"put"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"birdcage","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"},{"type":"line","ref":"l14"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rzob44.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1rzob44","locale":"en","adaptation":"reworked","notes":"Translated line by line; Goethe becomes Shakespeare as the adapt note suggests, euros become dollars. The two gifted parrots are birdcages the salesman holds and sets down; ptitsa in grey is the small old ugly parrot in the corner.","title":"The Boss","location":"magazin","cast":["muzhik","barmen","ptitsa"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"salesman","ptitsa":"parrot"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A customer walks into a pet shop and asks:","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"How much is that parrot there?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"A thousand dollars.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Why is it so expensive?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"That's a very gifted bird. He speaks fluently and can count to a hundred.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"And how much is that one?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Fifteen hundred dollars.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"That expensive again?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Oh, that's an even more gifted bird. He speaks three languages fluently and knows the complete works of Shakespeare by heart!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Then the customer spots a small, old, ugly parrot in the corner.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"And the one back there, that one must cost a lot less, surely?!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"No, that one costs three thousand dollars.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Excuse me? What can he do?!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"barmen","text":"I don't know either. He's never said a word, but the other two call him 'Boss'.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"magazin","cast":["muzhik","barmen","ptitsa"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"salesman","ptitsa":"parrot"},"looks":{"ptitsa":{"clothes":"#8a8a7a","skin":"#8a8a7a"}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"counter"},{"type":"move","who":"ptitsa","to":"right"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"birdcage","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","from":"off-left","to":"center"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"birdcage","action":"put"},{"type":"prop","who":"barmen","item":"birdcage","action":"hold"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"},{"type":"line","ref":"l11"},{"type":"line","ref":"l12"},{"type":"line","ref":"l13"},{"type":"line","ref":"l14"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1s58nhp.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1s58nhp","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"The 'favourite joke of my mother' remark is dropped. Two scenes: the warning at home, then the visit next door (wipe) where the neighbour holds the baby prop. The narration about being shown the baby is cut because the picture shows it. Lines kept as written.","title":"Keine Ohren","location":"kukhnya","cast":["zhena","vovochka"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka":"fritzchen"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Fritzchen muss mit seiner Mutter zur Nachbarin, die gerade ein Kind bekommen hat.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Das Kind hat keine Ohren!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Wenn wir rüber gehen, sag auf keinen Fall was darüber. Hast du verstanden?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Das Kind hat aber einen schönen Mund!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka","text":"Ja, damit er später auch mal schön reden und sprechen kann!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Das Kind hat aber eine schöne Nase!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka","text":"Ja, damit er später gut riechen kann!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Das Kind hat aber schöne Augen!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka","text":"Ja, damit er später auch mal gut sehen kann!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Naja, eine Brille kann er auch nicht tragen!","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"kukhnya","cast":["zhena","vovochka"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka":"fritzchen"},"beats":[{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","transition":"wipe","cast":["zhena","vovochka","devushka"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka":"fritzchen","devushka":"neighbor"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka","item":"baby","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"zhena","from":"off-left","to":"door"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1s58nhp.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1s58nhp","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Fritzchen becomes Vovochka as the adapt note allows. Translated line by line; the punchline keeps the glasses-need-ears logic. The neighbour holds the baby prop in the second scene.","title":"Без ушей","location":"kukhnya","cast":["zhena","vovochka"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka":"vovochka"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Вовочка с мамой должны идти к соседке, у которой только что родился ребёнок.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"У ребёнка нет ушей!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"Когда придём, ни в коем случае ничего об этом не говори. Понял?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"vovochka","text":"А у ребёнка красивый ротик!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka","text":"Да, чтобы он потом красиво говорил и разговаривал!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"А у ребёнка красивый носик!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka","text":"Да, чтобы он потом хорошо чувствовал запахи!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"А у ребёнка красивые глазки!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka","text":"Да, чтобы он потом хорошо видел!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Ну да, очки-то он всё равно носить не сможет!","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"kukhnya","cast":["zhena","vovochka"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka":"vovochka"},"beats":[{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","transition":"wipe","cast":["zhena","vovochka","devushka"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka":"vovochka","devushka":"neighbor"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka","item":"baby","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"zhena","from":"off-left","to":"door"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1s58nhp.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1s58nhp","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Fritzchen becomes Little Johnny as the adapt note allows. Translated line by line; the neighbour holds the baby prop in the second scene.","title":"No Ears","location":"kukhnya","cast":["zhena","vovochka"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka":"vovochka"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Little Johnny has to go with his mother to visit the neighbor, who has just had a baby.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"The baby has no ears!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"zhena","text":"When we go over there, don't you dare say anything about it. Do you understand?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"vovochka","text":"The baby has a lovely mouth!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka","text":"Yes, so he can talk and speak nicely when he grows up!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"The baby has a lovely nose!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka","text":"Yes, so he can smell well when he grows up!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"vovochka","text":"The baby has lovely eyes!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"devushka","text":"Yes, so he can see well when he grows up!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"vovochka","text":"Well, he won't be able to wear glasses anyway!","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"kukhnya","cast":["zhena","vovochka"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka":"vovochka"},"beats":[{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"}]},{"location":"gostinaya","transition":"wipe","cast":["zhena","vovochka","devushka"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","vovochka":"vovochka","devushka":"neighbor"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"devushka","to":"sofa"},{"type":"prop","who":"devushka","item":"baby","action":"hold"},{"type":"move","who":"zhena","from":"off-left","to":"door"},{"type":"move","who":"vovochka","from":"off-left","to":"left"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rytv02.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1rytv02","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"The penguin puppet now exists. Three scenes: the man finds the penguin on the street, the police station (they walk in and out), the next day on the street. Narration and lines kept as written.","title":"Der Pinguin","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Mitten in der Stadt findet ein Mann einen Pinguin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Er nimmt diesen mit auf ein Polizeirevier, um zu fragen, was er mit dem Tier machen soll.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Tja, guter Mann, also ich würde mit dem Pinguin in den Zoo gehen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Der Mann bedankt sich und zottelt mit dem Pinguin davon.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Am nächsten Tag trifft der Polizist den Mann und den Pinguin zufällig in der Stadt.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Sagen Sie mal, habe ich Ihnen nicht gesagt, dass Sie mit dem Pinguin in den Zoo gehen sollen?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ja, klar, da waren wir gestern, heute gehen wir ins Kino.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"line","ref":"l1"}]},{"location":"ofis","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","pingvin","sluzhivy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin","sluzhivy":"police-officer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["sluzhivy","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"police-officer","muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rytv02.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1rytv02","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; the penguin puppet now exists. Three scenes: street, police station (they walk in and out), street the next day.","title":"Пингвин","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Посреди города мужик находит пингвина.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Он ведёт его в полицейский участок, чтобы спросить, что ему делать с этим животным.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Ну, любезный, я бы сходил с пингвином в зоопарк.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужик благодарит и уходит вразвалочку вместе с пингвином.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"На следующий день полицейский случайно встречает в городе мужика с пингвином.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Послушайте, разве я вам не говорил сходить с пингвином в зоопарк?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Да, конечно, там мы были вчера, а сегодня идём в кино.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"line","ref":"l1"}]},{"location":"ofis","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","pingvin","sluzhivy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin","sluzhivy":"police-officer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["sluzhivy","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"police-officer","muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1rytv02.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1rytv02","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line, keeping 'go to the zoo with the penguin' so the punchline lands. Three scenes: street, police station (they walk in and out), street the next day.","title":"The Penguin","location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"In the middle of town, a man finds a penguin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"He takes it to the police station to ask what he should do with the animal.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Well, my good man, I'd go to the zoo with the penguin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"narrator","text":"The man thanks him and toddles off with the penguin.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"The next day the officer happens to run into the man and the penguin in town.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"sluzhivy","text":"Tell me, didn't I tell you to go to the zoo with the penguin?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.7},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Yes, of course. We went there yesterday, today we're going to the movies.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"ulitsa","cast":["muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"line","ref":"l1"}]},{"location":"ofis","transition":"cut","cast":["muzhik","pingvin","sluzhivy"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin","sluzhivy":"police-officer"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"sluzhivy","to":"desk"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"}]},{"location":"ulitsa","transition":"cut","cast":["sluzhivy","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"sluzhivy":"police-officer","muzhik":"everyman","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"}]}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1tmxtlw.de","jokeId":"de-witze-1tmxtlw","locale":"de","adaptation":"original","notes":"Lines kept as written; the attendant in overalls is barmen as a mechanic. One penguin puppet stands by the car for the five; a week later it and the driver wear sunglasses. The other penguins are a small penguin crowd by the car in both scenes; the pingvin puppet in front wears the sunglasses.","title":"Pinguine","location":"doroga","cast":["barmen","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"barmen":"mechanic","muzhik":"customer","pingvin":"penguin"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Ein Mann fährt an eine Tankstelle, und der Tankwart bemerkt, dass auf dem Rücksitz fünf Pinguine sitzen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Was zum Teufel, du hast fünf Pinguine auf dem Rücksitz.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich weiß!","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Die sind an der Ampel eingesprungen, und jetzt weiß ich nicht, was ich tun soll.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ich sag dir, was ich tun würde, ich würde sie in den Zoo bringen.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Das ist eine super Idee!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Eine Woche später fährt derselbe Fahrer mit denselben fünf Pinguinen vor, nur dass sie jetzt Sonnenbrillen tragen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Was machst du denn da? Ich dachte, ich hätte dir gesagt, du sollst die Pinguine in den Zoo bringen!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Wir waren doch dort! Wir hatten eine tolle Zeit!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Heute fahren wir an den Strand!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"doroga","cast":["barmen","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"barmen":"mechanic","muzhik":"customer","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"car"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}],"crowd":{"who":"penguins","size":"few"}},{"location":"doroga","transition":"wipe","cast":["barmen","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"barmen":"mechanic","muzhik":"customer","pingvin":"penguin"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["dark-glasses"]},"pingvin":{"add":["dark-glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"car"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}],"crowd":{"who":"penguins","size":"few"}}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1tmxtlw.ru","jokeId":"de-witze-1tmxtlw","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; the attendant is barmen as a mechanic. One penguin puppet stands by the car for the five; a week later it and the driver wear sunglasses. The other penguins are a small penguin crowd by the car in both scenes; the pingvin puppet in front wears the sunglasses.","title":"Пингвины","location":"doroga","cast":["barmen","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"barmen":"mechanic","muzhik":"customer","pingvin":"penguin"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"Мужик подъезжает к заправке, и заправщик замечает, что на заднем сиденье сидят пять пингвинов.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Какого чёрта, у тебя пять пингвинов на заднем сиденье.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Знаю!","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Они запрыгнули ко мне на светофоре, и теперь я не знаю, что делать.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"barmen","text":"Я скажу тебе, что бы я сделал, я бы отвёз их в зоопарк.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Отличная идея!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"Через неделю тот же водитель подъезжает с теми же пятью пингвинами, только теперь они в солнечных очках.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ты что творишь? Я же вроде сказал тебе отвезти пингвинов в зоопарк!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Так мы там были! Отлично провели время!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"muzhik","text":"А сегодня едем на пляж!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"doroga","cast":["barmen","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"barmen":"mechanic","muzhik":"customer","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"car"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}],"crowd":{"who":"penguins","size":"few"}},{"location":"doroga","transition":"wipe","cast":["barmen","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"barmen":"mechanic","muzhik":"customer","pingvin":"penguin"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["dark-glasses"]},"pingvin":{"add":["dark-glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"car"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}],"crowd":{"who":"penguins","size":"few"}}]}
{"id":"de-witze-1tmxtlw.en","jokeId":"de-witze-1tmxtlw","locale":"en","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated line by line; the attendant is barmen as a mechanic. One penguin puppet stands by the car for the five; a week later it and the driver wear sunglasses. The other penguins are a small penguin crowd by the car in both scenes; the pingvin puppet in front wears the sunglasses.","title":"Penguins","location":"doroga","cast":["barmen","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"barmen":"mechanic","muzhik":"customer","pingvin":"penguin"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A man pulls into a gas station, and the attendant notices five penguins sitting on the back seat.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"What the hell, you've got five penguins on the back seat.","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"I know!","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.2},{"character":"muzhik","text":"They jumped in at the traffic light, and now I don't know what to do.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"barmen","text":"I'll tell you what I'd do. I'd take them to the zoo.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"That's a great idea!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"narrator","text":"A week later the same driver pulls up with the same five penguins, only now they're wearing sunglasses.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"What are you doing? I thought I told you to take the penguins to the zoo!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"We went there! We had a great time!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.6},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Today we're going to the beach!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"laugh":"big"}],"scenes":[{"location":"doroga","cast":["barmen","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"barmen":"mechanic","muzhik":"customer","pingvin":"penguin"},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"car"},{"type":"line","ref":"l1"},{"type":"line","ref":"l2"},{"type":"line","ref":"l3"},{"type":"line","ref":"l4"},{"type":"line","ref":"l5"},{"type":"line","ref":"l6"}],"crowd":{"who":"penguins","size":"few"}},{"location":"doroga","transition":"wipe","cast":["barmen","muzhik","pingvin"],"roles":{"barmen":"mechanic","muzhik":"customer","pingvin":"penguin"},"looks":{"muzhik":{"add":["dark-glasses"]},"pingvin":{"add":["dark-glasses"]}},"beats":[{"type":"move","who":"barmen","to":"left"},{"type":"move","who":"muzhik","to":"right"},{"type":"move","who":"pingvin","to":"car"},{"type":"line","ref":"l7"},{"type":"line","ref":"l8"},{"type":"line","ref":"l9"},{"type":"line","ref":"l10"}],"crowd":{"who":"penguins","size":"few"}}]}
